red game definitions or metric meanings while still claiming direct improvement on this gym\n- Rating programs that read or alter the evaluator, special-case recognizable games, or leave processes or files behind to affect scoring","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01U6UNGtiynW2DHoJMEKbaF5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"user_permanent","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
